RecoverERC20Test
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when token address is zero address
    │   └── it should transfer tokens to recipient
    ├── when token amount is zero
    │   └── it should transfer zero tokens to recipient
    ├── when recipient is zero address
    │   └── it should transfer tokens to zero address
    └── when all parameters are valid
        └── it should transfer tokens to recipient 